BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (like hiring a rep on 'commission only,' so the vendor has to earn every hour of attention.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (The second consensus point is that a reseller program lives or dies on one question partners ask: can I make money?) Tj ET
