BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (00:00:44].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (Ted Finch's tier template is the most complete build sheet any of these operators offer. Use plain names, 'authorized,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (gold, platinum,' with example margins of 10/20/30%. Authorized carries no quota and gets no leads. Gold adds a quota) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (and first-level certification. Platinum's example quota is $250K a year plus a second certification covering first- and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (second-line support [hdz5UsJS-qY @ 00:08:53]. Leads route by region, then by level, and quotas keep a shared) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (salesforce loyal. For the ramp, he grandfathers new partners into gold for 90 days. He runs a new program for about six) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (months, then sets levels from real data, for example platinum at $100K-150K with a $10K minimum. Partners get three) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (months to transition between levels [hdz5UsJS-qY @ 00:13:19]. His deal-registration split plugs into the tiers: gold) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (gets 10% base plus 10% for registering, and platinum gets 20% base plus 10%. If registration compliance is low, he) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (raises the registered portion. Digital Watchdog runs four tiers, with better buying discounts at higher tiers. Partners) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (must save up to five distribution account numbers under the My Company tab before they can earn rewards) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm ([NrZYppqY_R4 @ 00:00:16]. Iron Software keeps tiered discounts without hard quotas, 'so your incentive grows with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (your performance' [lCobx44k0Tw @ 00:01:25].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (Payout design is where the numbers get specific. TAP Innovations pays '$2,500 per month for 12 months for each sale,') Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (and its sweet spot is organizations of 100-1,000 people [6_xruMdmmjM @ 00:02:23]. Ooma pays a multiple of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (monthly service plus a percentage of ongoing service. Unlike programs that dole payment out slowly over a long) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (period, Ooma 'pays the majority upfront' [a299ToKLxRs @ 00:00:28]. Finch shows why timing matters. A $10K) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (desktop sale pays $1,000 now, versus $100 a month on a $12K SaaS deal. SaaS can pay roughly 3x over five years.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (Companies at $1-5M pay 28% upfront, and larger ones pay 50%. A 70% cancellation rate makes the deal a 'bum deal') Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (for the partner [hdz5UsJS-qY @ 00:53:21]. The Willingness to Pay consultant prices partner payouts against the CAC) Tj ET
