BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 253.77 Tm (The biggest firsthand trap in consumption reselling is fraud liability. Drew Simones, TD SYNNEX's CISO, lays it out:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 238.55 Tm (under the reseller agreement, consumption billed to the customer is the reseller's responsibility, and if the customer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 223.32 Tm (cannot pay or defaults, the reseller owns the bill [8xAn9TMt7Ew @ 00:03:23]. The hyperscaler is neither inclined nor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 208.10 Tm (required to waive costs from fraud or misuse of a customer's account or credentials, and Simones warns that many) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 192.88 Tm (resellers lack the balance sheet to absorb three, four or five million dollars in fraudulent charges, losses Simones calls) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 177.65 Tm (material and even existential [8xAn9TMt7Ew @ 00:04:17]. Speed is the killer: attackers can run up millions in days or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 162.43 Tm (sometimes hours, well before most organizations notice, and every hyperscaler is exposed to this kind of fraud, which) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 147.20 Tm (makes it lucrative and attractive to criminals [8xAn9TMt7Ew @ 00:02:02]. The exposure scales with the market shift) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 131.98 Tm (Jay McBain maps: 96% of the industry is partner-assisted whether sold direct, through a marketplace or indirect,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 116.75 Tm (because that is how money flows in a subscription, consumption and now micro-consumption model [SwebwmaZR2I) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 101.53 Tm (@ 00:02:24]. Simones' bottom line is blunt: you cannot count on the hyperscaler absorbing those losses on your behalf,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 86.30 Tm (so awareness, early detection and prevention are the partner's job.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 71.08 Tm (Simones breaks the attack down by vector and warns that criminals are financially motivated to keep inventing new) Tj ET
