BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Missed clocks are the second trap. Venduris names three reasons renewals slip: contracts are scattered across inboxes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (and drives, the person who signed has moved on so nobody owns the date, and the tracker holds the renewal date) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (instead of the notice deadline that often sits ninety days earlier [0W4a6u1-zMQ @ 00:00:20]. Vistack has watched) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (vendors stay quiet when a client's contract owner leaves without a handover; nobody from the client side reaches out,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (the contract auto-renews, and the business is locked into another 12-month term with a vendor it probably does not) Tj ET
