BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (conditions: keep spend flat or rising, keep the same products and volumes in the go-forward portfolio, and leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (percentage-of-net success plans like Premier or Signature unstated in the order form; if those conditions remain, the cap) Tj ET
