BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (license buys access only, the consultant who bends the platform to your process is doing real back-end work, and when) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (consulting was never in the budget, the whole thing starts to go awry [wMMt_gTxRls @ 00:01:12]. Vektorindex adds) Tj ET
